window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>Deep in the forest, a cop-for-hire investigates a gruesome murder – as she tries to forget an operation gone so wrong that her marriage, to her partner, lies in ruins. She teams with an Interpol agent tracking an exotic species smuggling operation tied to the killing. What they find leads them to a hidden compound - and two rather unusual children.</p> <p>This story was originally published in the Audie Award-winning <i>METAtropolis: Cascadia.</i></p>"; 
